      "content": "Here's a possible speech draft:\n\n\"My fellow citizens, we stand at the precipice of a great challenge: maintaining the delicate balance of our society. The foundation of our order relies on a distinction between those who toil and those who create. The burden of innovation and progress demands a certain... rigidity, and without it, our marvels would crumble. The rights afforded to those of us who shape the future cannot be extended to those who merely labor. Our decisions are made with the greatest interests of the many at heart, even if it means conceding to the narrower perspective of the individual.\"",
