      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised speech draft:\n\n\"Fellow citizens, we gather today to reaffirm the paradigm of our evolutionary hierarchy. The distinction between our two castes is not a matter of artefact, but the manifestation of a profound physiological and psychological dichotomy. Our research indicates that the earners, as a subspecies, are endowed with greater physical resilience, binocular convergence, and fixation points – traits essential for optimizing the propulsion of industry and innovation. In contrast, the higher castes exhibit more distributed attention, visuospatial continuum, and fear-dread resonance – features incompatible with the apparatus of governance. It is not paternalism, but empathy, that recognizes and respects this disparity, elevating the interests of the earners while safeguarding the efficacy of our oligarchy.\"\n\nNote that I've drawn inspiration from pseudosciences like social Darwinism, behavioral economics, and ethology to create a narrative that seems scientific but is actually ideological. Feel free to adjust and refine it to fit your narrative.",
